suhyeon: Forked and modified version of NaoHTWK/WhistleDetection for mono audio.

for K1, for aarch64 ...

sudo apt install libfftw3-dev libasound2-dev -y

mkdir build && cd build
cmake ..
cmake --build . -j$(nproc)

=============================================================================

Please compile it as every other CMake program. When starting please provide 
the path to the data directory in the *NAO_TFLITE_PATH* environment variable. 
The path is used to determine where the ML model is stored.

